sentences.text:
The petitioner-accused No.1 is directed to be enlarged on bail in S.C.No.126/2023 pending on the file of V Addl. District & Sessions Judge, Mysuru arising out of Crime No.173/2022 of Udayagiri Police Station, Mysuru city registered for the offences punishable under Sections 498A, 302, 304(B) R/w 34 of IPC & Sections 3, 4 and 6 of Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961, subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/-
(Rupees One lakhs only) with one surety for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
 NC: 2023:KHC:29006 Janab Syed Umar vs State Of Karnataka on 16 August, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/141732607/
